<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\春の山.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を歩く2人.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田森1朝.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Mmm... I'm sleepy... I want a bath..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry. Stick with us for a bit."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"We were in the middle of our deductions, after all... 
{PAUSE ""}
For this genius girl, Erina Goto, not going was never an opt... 
{PAUSE ""}
Fwaah..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">As planned, we headed for that cave.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Nothing in particular had happened after that last night.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I'd opened the window to let the wind in and slept with the cherry branch by my pillow, but my intuition hadn't kicked in.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Was a branch like this no use after all?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But since nothing dangerous had happened in the end, I couldn't say that for sure either...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "500" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜飛び回る左向き.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "T" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n-600\r\n500\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n-600\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜飛ぶ右向き.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n960\r\n500\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n960\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Yoo-hoo!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"That </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="ましら">monkey</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s lively first thing in the morning..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was leaping around among the trees.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Yesterday's tiredness seemed to have been blown away somewhere.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Being young sure is nice...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Come to think of it, </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="5">, how did the hunting go yesterday?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Ah... In the end, all I did was catch one frog. 
{PAUSE ""}
Surprisingly, <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> seems to be the considerate type, and she said she'd rather chat than hunt... 
{PAUSE ""}
And then I got shown to <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE>'s secret base."<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Come to think of it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had carried all our luggage yesterday, and come to the rescue of </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2"> when she got dragged into the impression contest... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">She really did seem to be pretty considerate.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地昼.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Where we were led was a short way in, after pushing through the trees of the forest―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">A hole gaping open in the rocks.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">A ceiling a little lower than my height.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you sure this is it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I tried standing where it seemed to overlap with the vision I'd seen yesterday.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"............</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Yeah, this is definitely it."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE> seems to have used it as a secret base when she was a kid too, so there may be some connection here."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If so, it's very possible that </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, her childhood friends, came and went here too.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">And it was a place the people of the settlement didn't know about.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">No, maybe </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> only assumes nobody knows, and residents have been using it for generations.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\歩く響く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地昼中.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">So this was the secret base―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Sunlight filtered faintly through the gaps in the rock ceiling.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">In yesterday's vision, I hadn't been able to see the background clearly.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">This really is the place, isn't it? Am I right...?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE>, does this secret base go any farther back than here?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Farther back...? This is the very back?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The sun was shining in, but the angle was still shallow, and it was dim and a little cramped.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I couldn't clearly see all the way into the corners.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Dark and cramped...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\深淵からの呼び声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">Yesterday, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had named 'a dark, cramped place' as a condition for </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s intuition to kick in.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">This matched that condition too...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, it's a dark, cramped place..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yeah... so </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> was in here..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It matches so well it's creepy."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But there was nothing especially strange to be seen.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\秘密基地春花五島.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">An old rush mat was spread on the ground, and in a corner was trash from snacks and juice.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Other than that, nothing stood out...</STYLE><PG>
"............
{PAUSE ""}
This place is a little strange after all."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"It's true it stands out too much to call it a secret base... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">There's no way nobody would've noticed it for 800 years..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No, that's not what I mean... 
{PAUSE ""}
Hey, <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE>, what happens here when it rains?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Rain...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　It pours down through the hole in the ceiling like a waterfall! Then I can't use it for a while..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Did it not rain around here yesterday...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Seems like yesterday's was just on the mountain road, so I don't think it rained that much around here?"</STYLE><PG>
"Even so, this place is strange. 
{PAUSE ""}
Yesterday the mat was a little damp, so it must have rained here too. 
{PAUSE ""}
This spot is a little lower than the entrance, so there's nowhere for the rain to drain to."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">True, there were no puddles here.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The air was a little damp, but for a hole like this, the humidity was about right.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Isn't it draining out through some crack in the rock you can't see?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"In that case, there should be more moss and such growing. 
{PAUSE ""}
No moss means that even when rain flows in, it <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="は">drains away</STYLE> very quickly. 
{PAUSE ""}
In other words, there's a big hole or gap we can't see―"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Goto<STYLE ID="2"> said so and took hold of the mat.</STYLE><PG>
"Hup... 
{PAUSE ""}
Huh...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2"> didn't seem able to peel the mat off.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地ゴザねじ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">On closer inspection, there were </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="くい">stakes</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> driven into the four corners.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Just to hold down the mat of a secret base, <STYLE ID="12" RUBY="くい">stakes</STYLE>...?
{PAUSE ""}
　There's definitely something hidden under here!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">And then </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2"> tried to rip the mat up by force.</STYLE><PG>
{QUAKE "000" "QUAKE" "1" "5" "5" "500" "30"}
"Ngh-ngh-ngh...!
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKESTOP "0"}
　Haah, it's no good... This hemp mat is as thick as a carpet... 
{PAUSE ""}
And it looks old, but only because the stains stand out. It actually seems newer than I expected..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"So someone changed the mat here recently?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Probably. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE>, when did this mat get changed?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh...? I dunno... It's dark in here, and I never paid attention to that stuff..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Then </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2"> began studying the </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="くい">stakes</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> closely.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">With the light not reaching them well, I'd have thought they were hard to see...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="2"> found the head of a </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="くい">stake</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="な">ran</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> the pad of her finger over it.</STYLE><PG>
"There's a groove for a screwdriver. These weren't driven in. Sockets for bolts are buried in the ground, and the mat is fastened with bolts. 
{PAUSE ""}
That means the mat gets taken off pretty often..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"What!? So lots of people have been coming into my secret base!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Nooo..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, who had thought the base was hers alone, learned that people had been coming and going, and a heartbroken look came over her face.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花横顔逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"At least it means there's something under here... And a space big enough for water to flow into..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No doubt about it... I'm sure <STYLE ID="14">Erika-chan</STYLE> knows about this too."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地昼中.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="15">"Is someone there!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Suddenly, a voice came from the direction of the entrance.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\歩く響く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭抱える.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Cr-crap! Hide!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"There's nowhere to hide in a place like this...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
